OL,3,GNEWSABody found in search for missing
OL,4,Aboy, 15, on holiday
OL,5,
OL,6,FA body has been found during a search
OL,7,Ffor a missing 15-year-old boy who was
OL,8,Freported to have got into difficulty in
OL,9,Fthe sea while on a family holiday.
OL,11,FOn 1 September the coastguard said a
OL,12,Fmajor sea search for the teen at
OL,13,FMarloes Sands beach, Pembrokeshire, had
OL,14,Fbeen called off after two days.
OL,16,FHM Coastguard received a report that
OL,17,Fthree people were in difficulty at
OL,18,F15:30 BST on 31 August.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
