OL,3,GNEWSABody found in search for missing
OL,4,Aboy, 15, on holiday
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo were able to get out of the water,
OL,7,Fbut the teenage boy, who was visiting
OL,8,Ffrom Yorkshire, was unaccounted for.
OL,9,FThe search was suspended at 19:30 BST
OL,10,Fon Monday.
